  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nelson Souza",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:09:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:09:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Is this the, um, the restaurant? Wanted to ask about table for tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:09:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, no, I'm afraid this is the City Clerk's office at Newport City Hall. Which restaurant were you trying to reach?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:09:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Wrong number then. Dialed wrong, I guess. Was trying to get place on Thames Street. Got number off old list, so, you know. Probably from last decade."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:09:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Well, that happens. I'd suggest looking up the restaurant's current number online or on their website. Numbers change a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:09:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, good idea. Sorry, one more thing. Speaker thing in my kitchen, the smart one, keeps answering stuff I never asked. Just now it said something while I dialed. Thought maybe I got you through that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:09:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm, no, I don't think so. This is just a regular line, a person answering. You dialed us directly, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:09:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Still not sure how I got here. Anyway. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:10:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble at all. Happy New Year's Eve to you. I hope you find your table."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T13:10:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, you too. Bye."
    }
  ],
